-- classroom.say
kind Student
  name is Unknown
  grade is 0

  on passing
    return me.grade >= 70
  end

  on report
    if send passing to me
      show .me.name scored .me.grade and is passing
    else
      show .me.name scored .me.grade and needs help
    end
  end
end

make a Student called alice with name Alice, grade 95
make a Student called bob with name Bob, grade 60
make a Student called charlie with name Charlie, grade 82

put list alice, bob, charlie into students

show Class Report
for each s in students
  send report to s
end

put students where send passing to it into passing
show (.passing.count) out of (.students.count) students passing
